/E (To answer the research question, we conducted a survey. We performed this study from July to December 2025, and cybersecurity professionals from 62 organisations participated. Most respondents represent government organisations and the IT sector, primarily based in the Netherlands, limiting generalisability. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4 5]
