/P 67 0 R
/T (We asked the few organisations that started the PQC migration how they began. We combine their answers with information from the ANSSI, NCSC, the EU Roadmap, and our expertise to give some hands-on tips we present in the coming sections.)
/E (We asked the few organisations that started the PQC migration how they began. We combine their answers with information from the ANSSI, NCSC, the EU Roadmap, and our expertise to give some hands-on tips we present in the coming sections.)
