426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (There is a clear tendency to prioritize short-term risks above the risk a quantum computer poses to the long term. This is despite the fact that many respondents acknowledged the potential long-term impact. Some respondents also mentioned a lack of involvement from top management, indicating that the topic has not yet become a strategic priority.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K []
>>
